        {
          "text": "UAbrahama waphinda wakhuluma wathi kuyo: Mhlawumbe kuzafunyanwa khona abangamatshumi amane. Yathi: Kangiyikukwenza ngenxa yalabo abangamatshumi amane. ",
          "type": "text",
