              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasesithi: INkosi kayingathukutheli, ngizakhuluma kanye kuphela; mhlawumbe kuzafunyanwa khona abalitshumi. Yathi: Kangiyikuwubhubhisa ngenxa yalabo abalitshumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
